{
    "title": "Photo Video Maker With Music",
    "description": "<b>Video Maker With Music & Photo is an easy-to-use, full-featured free HD video editor and video maker with photos, background music, magic effects, stylish templates, Animated Video Editor, text, audio, transition effects, animated stickers, blur background and more.</b> Just simply select your photos and videos to make HD videos without watermark, festival video status, anniversary photo status, birthdays, weddings, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Eve and other precious moments for YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, WhatsApp, and Facebook.\r\n\r\n<b>Video Maker With Music & Photo is also the best professional photo video maker, with many wonderful video templates, moving music, beautiful frames, filters.</b> You can use video templates for free to create creative vlogs and lyrical videos with fashion effects, cool transitions, and emoticons in one click.\r\n\r\n<b>Video Maker With Music & Photo is also a powerful video editing tool and photo editing tool all in one.</b> Trim videos, compress videos, extract music from videos, edit photos, everything can be done in this powerful video editor.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08<b>Top Highlights of Video Maker & Video Editor</b>\r\n\u2713 Make Video Movie and Photo Slideshow with music.\r\n\u2713 Various video templates: Christmas, birthday, love, wedding, vintage, movies, family, ....\r\n\u2713Multi-Layer editing, add music, sound effects, glitch effects, stickers & text\r\n\u2713 Easy to Trim, Cut, Split, Merge, Compress, Convert Videos.\r\n\u27134K export, save HD video without quality loss\r\n\u2713Export video in any ratio, 1:1, 16:9, 3:4, 3:2, etc.\r\n\u2713 Share videos to Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, WhatsApp, Facebook, Twitter, Messenger, Mail, and more.\r\n\u2713 FREE 100% & No Watermark! \r\n\r\n\u2728<b>All-in-one Video Editor & Photo Slideshow Maker</b>\r\n- Use elaborate themes to create music video, slideshow or vlog instantly.\r\n- 200+ popular fully licensed music, and you can add local songs from your device too. \r\n- Adjust music volume, use music fade in/ fade out option.\r\n- 1500+ animated stickers and emoji. Aesthetics, doodle, birthdays, neon, etc.\r\n- 30+ text styles and fonts to create artistic subtitles.\r\n- Add stunning filters to make your video different.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf37<b>Professional Video Editing tools</b>\r\n- Split or merge video, convert video into MP3 file, collage and loop video clips easily.\r\n- Zoom in or out. Let your audience focus on the region you want.\r\n- 60+ awesome transitions. Combine two clips with transition effects.\r\n- Doodle on video, draw anything you like on the screen.\r\n- Use video reverse to make funny video or original vlog.\r\n- Blurred background and speed adjustment features available.\r\n- Fantastic Materials Center: Themes/filters/stickers/gif images/memes/emojis/fonts/sound effects/FX and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf35<b>Powerful Photo Edit</b>\r\n- Edit Photo, add text, stickers, filters, crop photos\r\n- Animal, blur effect, cutout effect, love effect, mirror effect, magician effect\r\n- 100+ Stylized templates including Film, Magazine, Ripped Paper\r\n- Adjust brightness, contrast, saturation, hue, etc.\r\n\r\nThe top Video Maker With Music & Photo helps you create videos with various cool effects and music to make your videos more exciting. Come and download, record your special moments and  share to YouTube, Instagram, Tik Tok, Facebook, Messenger, Whatsapp, Twitter.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Video Maker With Music &amp; Photo is an easy-to-use, full-featured free HD video editor and video maker with photos, background music, magic effects, stylish templates, Animated Video Editor, text, audio, transition effects, animated stickers, blur background and more.</b> Just simply select your photos and videos to make HD videos without watermark, festival video status, anniversary photo status, birthdays, weddings, Valentine&#39;s Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Eve and other precious moments for YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, WhatsApp, and Facebook.<br><br><b>Video Maker With Music &amp; Photo is also the best professional photo video maker, with many wonderful video templates, moving music, beautiful frames, filters.</b> You can use video templates for free to create creative vlogs and lyrical videos with fashion effects, cool transitions, and emoticons in one click.<br><br><b>Video Maker With Music &amp; Photo is also a powerful video editing tool and photo editing tool all in one.</b> Trim videos, compress videos, extract music from videos, edit photos, everything can be done in this powerful video editor.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08<b>Top Highlights of Video Maker &amp; Video Editor</b><br>\u2713 Make Video Movie and Photo Slideshow with music.<br>\u2713 Various video templates: Christmas, birthday, love, wedding, vintage, movies, family, ....<br>\u2713Multi-Layer editing, add music, sound effects, glitch effects, stickers &amp; text<br>\u2713 Easy to Trim, Cut, Split, Merge, Compress, Convert Videos.<br>\u27134K export, save HD video without quality loss<br>\u2713Export video in any ratio, 1:1, 16:9, 3:4, 3:2, etc.<br>\u2713 Share videos to Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, WhatsApp, Facebook, Twitter, Messenger, Mail, and more.<br>\u2713 FREE 100% &amp; No Watermark! <br><br>\u2728<b>All-in-one Video Editor &amp; Photo Slideshow Maker</b><br>- Use elaborate themes to create music video, slideshow or vlog instantly.<br>- 200+ popular fully licensed music, and you can add local songs from your device too. <br>- Adjust music volume, use music fade in/ fade out option.<br>- 1500+ animated stickers and emoji. Aesthetics, doodle, birthdays, neon, etc.<br>- 30+ text styles and fonts to create artistic subtitles.<br>- Add stunning filters to make your video different.<br><br>\ud83c\udf37<b>Professional Video Editing tools</b><br>- Split or merge video, convert video into MP3 file, collage and loop video clips easily.<br>- Zoom in or out. Let your audience focus on the region you want.<br>- 60+ awesome transitions. Combine two clips with transition effects.<br>- Doodle on video, draw anything you like on the screen.<br>- Use video reverse to make funny video or original vlog.<br>- Blurred background and speed adjustment features available.<br>- Fantastic Materials Center: Themes/filters/stickers/gif images/memes/emojis/fonts/sound effects/FX and more.<br><br>\ud83c\udf35<b>Powerful Photo Edit</b><br>- Edit Photo, add text, stickers, filters, crop photos<br>- Animal, blur effect, cutout effect, love effect, mirror effect, magician effect<br>- 100+ Stylized templates including Film, Magazine, Ripped Paper<br>- Adjust brightness, contrast, saturation, hue, etc.<br><br>The top Video Maker With Music &amp; Photo helps you create videos with various cool effects and music to make your videos more exciting. Come and download, record your special moments and  share to YouTube, Instagram, Tik Tok, Facebook, Messenger, Whatsapp, Twitter.",
